Yihui,

I would like to have the selectizeInput update with the columns from the chosen file.  Is this the correct way to do it?  I do not want to use an Action Button, but rather just have the selectizeInput.  Can you tell me what I am doing wrong in the following code?

server.R
dataSource1 <- reactive({

    switch(input$dataSelection1,
            "File1" = File1,
            "File2" = File2,
           "File3" = File3,
           "File4" = File4)
    })

  observeEvent(input$update, {
    updateSelectizeInput(session, 'dataSelection', choices = names(dataSource1))
  })

ui.R

selectizeInput('dataSelection', 'DATASELECTION', choice = NULL)

