For some reason, a data frame  uploaded to shiny does not act the way mtcars does.  In particular, in the example below, I want to calculate the number of rows of the data set, just like in the example.  I cannot find a way to deliver the number of rows to the observeEvent that requires it.

The error I get is:

Warning: Unhandled error in observer: object 'vals' not found
observeEvent(input$plot1_click)

Here is my data, saved as a tab delimited text file:

"conc"    "intensity"
    1    2.07333369724137
