The error message is correct. vals does not exist in the event handler for the plot click. vals is defined in another event listener. Remember that all R variables are local variables. vals is deleted once the event handler function for the button click reaches its end. If you want to make a variable global, so that it persists and can be used later, use <<- to assign a value to it.

